e=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a> and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Epic_Menechtarun_Scavenger\" title=\"Named item sets\">Epic Menechtarun Scavenger</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Epic_Menechtarun_Scavenger\" title=\"Named item sets\">Epic Menechtarun Scavenger</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Physical and Magical Resistance Rating<br />+20 Artifact bonus to Positive, Negative, and Repair Amplification</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Demon_Scale_Armor.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Demon_Scale_Armor.png/420px-Epic_Demon_Scale_Armor.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"744\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Demon_Scale_Armor.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Crafting\" title=\"Legendary Crafting\">Legendary Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Demon_Scale_Armor\" title=\"Item:Legendary Demon Scale Armor\">Legendary Demon Scale Armor</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>Scale mail fashioned from the hide of a Marilith Demon. The flexible scales allow this armor to be classified as Light as well as granting some of the Marilith's protections to the wearer. The inherently magical nature of the scales also reduces the <a href=\"/page/Arcane_spell_failure\" title=\"Arcane spell failure\">Arcane Spell Failure</a>.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>Can also be used in <a href=\"/page/Catalyst_Crafting\" title=\"Catalyst Crafting\">Catalyst Crafting</a> to make <a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Scales_of_Demogorgon\" title=\"Item:Legendary Scales of Demogorgon\">Legendary Scales of Demogorgon</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817171327\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.153 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4408/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33317/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12677/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 10/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n101.63%  137.260     53 Template:IO\n100.00%  135.064      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  135.064      1 -total\n 97.88%  132.200      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 35.37%   47.770      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 34.59%   46.719      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 33.34%   45.030      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 31.37%   42.370      2 Template:InCategory\n 22.84%   30.853      9 Template:Popup\n 17.45%   23.562      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:10398-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817171327 and revision id 693963. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
